            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h1",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h3>No Facial Recognition</h3><p>Flow detects and tracks human shapes using skeletal tracking and motion analysis. We do not capture, process, or store facial features.</p><p><strong>Technical approach: Shape detection, height estimation, trajectory tracking—zero biometric data.</strong></p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_aqpNXK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-camera",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#b9c87c",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#a0b842",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "border_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h1",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h3>No Video Storage</h3><p>Raw camera feeds are processed in real-time at the edge, then discarded. Only aggregate metrics (counts, dwell times, zones) are stored.</p><p><strong>Edge processing: Metrics extracted locally, video never leaves the device, no cloud storage of footage.</strong></p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_tTyycj": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-lock",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#f9fafb",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "#11243e",
            "border_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h1",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h3>No Personal Identifiers</h3><p>Flow does not collect names, contact information, payment details, or any PII. Anonymous session IDs are generated per visit and cannot be linked to individuals.</p><p>Data minimization: Only metrics required for operational analytics. No tracking across visits or stores.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_RnmbJT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "",
            "icon_color": "",
            "background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "1",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h3>GDPR & CCPA Compliance by Architecture</h3><p>Flow qualifies as \"non-personal data\" under GDPR Article 4 because the data cannot identify individuals. No DPIA (Data Protection Impact Assessment) is required for typical retail deployments.</p><p>GDPR Principles Applied:</p><ul><li>Data minimization: Only essential operational metrics</li><li>Purpose limitation: Retail operations only, no secondary use</li><li>Storage limitation: 13-month retention, configurable</li><li>Integrity & confidentiality: AES-256 encryption, access controls</li></ul><p>CCPA Compliance:</p><ul><li>No \"sale\" of data—customer data stays isolated per retailer</li><li>Customer data ownership maintained</li><li>Full data export available on request</li><li>Deletion within 30 days upon request</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
      },
